/ActualText ([Root Cause: ML Calculation Bottleneck]\( Spring Boot synchronously waited for results on a heavy, real-time response-challenging video data processing task.\n[Phenomenon: Resource Waste]\( Clients had to maintain connections indefinitely to get a response, lowering server resource efficiency.)
/K [3]
/S /Span
/Type /StructElem
/P 7129 0 R
/Pg 6543 0 R
>>
endobj
