/ActualText ( Realized the importance of asynchronous processing and resource efficiency.\n Since this project requires only unidirectional push, transitioning to SSE \(Server-Sent-Events\) could achieve a lighter implementation without external dependencies.)
/K [7]
/S /Span
/Type /StructElem
/P 7137 0 R
/Pg 6543 0 R
>>
endobj
