7138 0 obj
<<
/ActualText ( Video similarity analysis took over 48 seconds on average, exceeding the synchronous request handling limits of the Spring Boot API server.\n Clients failed to receive results, causing disconnected connections.)
/K [8]
/S /Span
/Type /StructElem
/P 7139 0 R
/Pg 6543 0 R
>>
endobj
7139 0 obj
<<
/K [7138 0 R]
