7142 0 obj
<<
/ActualText ([WebSocket Adoption]\( Replaced one-time HTTP connections with a persistent connection channel between the client and server.\n[Asynchronous Processing & Result Push]\( Returned "Receipt Complete" instantly to prevent timeouts, and pushed results immediately upon calculation completion.)
/K [10]
/S /Span
/Type /StructElem
/P 7143 0 R
/Pg 6543 0 R
>>
