/ActualText ([Initial Boot Load]\( High CPU/Memory spike during startup due to dependency loading and JPA initialization.\n[Resource Exhaustion & Bottleneck]\( Memory shortage in Free Tier t2.micro \(1GB RAM\) led to CPU bottleneck and freeze.\n[Monopoly & Cascading Failure]\( Lack of container isolation allowed resource monopoly, depriving other containers.)
