/ActualText (Deployment Optimization\(- JPA Config: Set ddl-auto: none to reduce boot load.\(- Resource Limit: Restricted Spring Boot container to CPU 0.5 and Memory 512M.\nMemory Improvement\( Configured 2GB Swap space to absorb startup memory peaks.)
/K [9]
