/ActualText ([SQL Join Behavior]\( Many-to-Many hashtag filtering triggered internal SQL JOINs, generating N rows for N hashtags at the DB level.\n[N+1 Problem]\( Querying associated hashtags for each duplicate post triggered extra queries, causing an N+1 issue.)
